   |                ^^^^^^^^^ compares bits
   |
   = why: NaN has many bit patterns; `0/0 === NaN` is false
   = fix: test for NaN with `isnan(x)`, which matches every bit pattern   [manual]
   = docs: corset explain nan-compare

